        engineLifespan: "200 000 - 350 000+ km (The M119 6.0L AMG is a masterpiece of early tuning. The closed-deck aluminum block and custom forged internals are incredibly robust. However, because these were hand-built, the lifespan depends heavily on the quality of the internal assembly and the rigor of the maintenance performed by previous owners. Excessive heat buildup in the tight C140 engine bay is the primary limiting factor for longevity.)",
