        maxPowerStockInternals: "700+ hp (The M120 7.3L block is a legend. The internal rotating assembly is so strong and overbuilt that this exact architecture formed the basis for the Pagani Zonda hypercar engine. The stock internals can handle forced induction effortlessly, though the transmission cannot handle the torque.)",
