          "Body Rust: The early C215 is highly susceptible to structural rust in the wheel arches, lower door edges, and subframe mounts.",
          "722.6 Conductor Plate Failure: The electronic speed sensors on the transmission conductor plate fail, forcing the car into Limp Mode (locked in 2nd gear).",
          "Valve Cover & Rear Main Seal Leaks: Due to age, the rubber valve cover gaskets and the rear main seal frequently weep oil, causing burning smells.",
