              "Ignition weakness under boost: High cylinder pressure makes plug and coil condition critical. Weak ignition parts show up first as under-load misfires or inconsistent acceleration.",
              "PCV / crankcase ventilation contamination: Breather deterioration increases oil-vapor ingestion, accelerates carbon buildup, and can create vague drivability symptoms that are easy to misdiagnose.",
              "Charge-air leakage: Small pressure leaks in hoses, joints, or intercooler plumbing can noticeably blunt the facelift car's stronger torque delivery.",
