                  "Electronic Water Pump Failure: The M254 utilizes a fully electronic water pump to manage complex thermal zones. It frequently fails or leaks after 80,000 km.",
                  "Intake Carbon Buildup: Standard direct-injection flaw; frequent engine shut-offs during 'sail mode' coasting exacerbate the buildup of oily sludge on the intake valves.",
                  "8G-DCT Mechatronic Sensitivity: The new 8-speed dual-clutch transmission shifts rapidly but shudders aggressively if the fluid is not perfectly clean.",
