                maxPowerStockInternals: "220 - 240+ hp. This is the greatest secret of the facelift CLA 200 d. It is mechanically identical to the 190 hp CLA 220 d variant. A Stage 1 ECU flash removes the artificial factory software restrictions, instantly bumping the horsepower from 150 hp to roughly 210 hp and pushing torque to 450 Nm safely. The block and internals are massively over-engineered for the 150 hp factory rating.",
            
